DESCRIPTION:Title of Presentation:\n"Evaluating Real-World Results in Attr
 acting and Retaining Inclusive Elite Talent into Cardiothoracic Surgery"\
 n\nSpeaker:\nLeah Backhus\, MD\, MPH\, FACS\nThelma and Henry Doelger Pro
 fessor of Cardiothoracic Surgery\nStanford University\n\n\nThis talk will
  be recorded and made available for on-demand viewing. Please visit our w
 ebsite linked below for access.\n\nThe mission of Surgery Grand Rounds is
  to provide an educational format that has a broad appeal to Duke faculty
 \, residents\, staff\, and students. Grand Rounds consists of a broad ran
 ge of topics that are presented by local\, regional\, and international s
 peakers on clinical education\, research science\, and developments in te
 chnology\, and also addresses other related issues that may affect our cu
 rrent and future surgeons. Physicians who attend Surgery Grand Rounds are
  eligible to receive CME credit.\n\nFor more information\, please visit o
 ur website by clicking on MORE EVENT INFORMATION below
